# Frontend app (`frontend/`)

Applies only when editing files under **`frontend/`**. Do not use these rules for `backend/`.

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4
- UI: [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) primitives in `src/components/ui/`
- Motion: **Framer Motion** (`framer-motion`) for dashboard animations
- Icons: **Lucide** (`lucide-react`)
- Auth: `src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx`, tokens via `src/lib/api.ts`
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` → `src/lib/env.ts`

## Structure

```
frontend/src/
├── app/
│   ├── globals.css          # Theme tokens, glass utilities, cursor defaults
│   ├── dashboard/           # Authenticated shell (dark “Command Center” UI)
│   ├── login, register, …   # Public auth (may still be light — match dashboard when touching)
│   └── pay/[invoiceId]
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                  # shadcn primitives — extend, don’t duplicate
│   └── dashboard/           # MeshBackground, StatCard, AnimatedNumber, …
├── contexts/
└── lib/api.ts
```

