## Design system (required for all new UI)

**Aesthetic:** Dark glass UI — deep space background (`#0a0f1a`), teal/cyan accents, subtle motion. Use CSS variables (`--dash-*`) and `glass-panel` — never hardcode light-theme cards (`bg-white`, `text-gray-800`) on dashboard pages.

### Tokens (`globals.css` `:root`)

| Token | Value / usage |
|-------|----------------|
| `--background` | `#0a0f1a` — page/shell bg |
| `--foreground` | `#e2e8f0` — body text |
| `--primary` | `#2dd4bf` — teal accent |
| `--accent` | `#fbbf24` — warnings / pending |
| `--card` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.05)` |
| `--border` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` |
| `--muted` | `#94a3b8` — secondary text |

### Utility classes (prefer these over one-off styles)

| Class | Use for |
|-------|---------|
| `glass-panel` | Standard content card (tables, lists, sections) |
| `glass-panel-strong` | Hero / emphasis blocks (e.g. collection momentum) |
| `text-gradient` | Brand highlight on headings (“Pro”, “Center”) |
| `animate-shimmer` | Loading placeholders (with `Skeleton`) |

### Color semantics

| Meaning | Tailwind |
|---------|----------|
| Success / collected | `text-teal-300`, `text-teal-400`, `bg-teal-500/10` |
| Pending / warning | `text-amber-300`, `text-amber-400`, `bg-amber-500/10` |
| Info / rate | `text-cyan-300`, cyan gradients |
| Secondary | `text-slate-400`, `text-slate-500` |
| Primary text | `text-slate-200`, `text-white` |
| Borders / dividers | `border-white/10`, `border-white/5` |
| Hover surfaces | `hover:bg-white/5`, `hover:bg-white/[0.04]` |

### Typography

- Page title (dashboard): `text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl` + optional `text-gradient` span
- Section title: `text-lg font-semibold text-white`
- Section subtitle: `text-sm text-slate-500`
- Stat / KPI value: `text-3xl font-bold tabular-nums` + accent color
- Eyebrow / live label: `text-sm text-teal-400/90` with Lucide icon

### Layout (dashboard)

- Shell: `dashboard/layout.tsx` — fixed sidebar `w-[260px]`, `MeshBackground`, main `ml-[260px] p-8`
- Sidebar: `bg-[#0d1324]/80 backdrop-blur-2xl border-r border-white/10`
- Active nav: gradient bg `from-teal-500/20 to-cyan-500/10`, `layoutId="nav-active"` pill on left
- Content spacing: `space-y-8` between major sections; grids `gap-4` / `gap-6`

### Components — reuse before creating

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Button, Input, Dialog, Table, … | `@/components/ui/*` |
| Page background | `MeshBackground` from `@/components/dashboard/mesh-background` |
| KPI card | `StatCard` + `AnimatedNumber` |
| Progress bar | `@/components/ui/progress` |
| Loading | `@/components/ui/skeleton` or `DashboardSkeleton` pattern |
| Toasts | `sonner` (`toast.success` / `toast.error`) |

### shadcn/ui usage

- Import from `@/components/ui/…`; override with `className` for dark theme
- Primary CTA: `rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-cyan-500 … shadow-teal-500/25 border-0`
- Outline on dark: `border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/10`
- Inputs on dark (when added): `bg-white/5 border-white/10 text-slate-200 placeholder:text-slate-500`

### Motion (Framer Motion)

Use on dashboard pages and new interactive blocks — keep subtle and fast.

```tsx
'use client'
import { motion } from 'framer-motion'

// Stagger children
const container = { hidden: { opacity: 0 }, show: { opacity: 1, transition: { staggerChildren: 0.08 } } }

// Card entrance
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 24 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.5, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }}
  whileHover={{ y: -4 }}
/>

// List/table rows: delay by index `0.4 + i * 0.05`
```

- Nav active indicator: `layoutId="nav-active"` spring transition
- Prefer `motion.tr` / `motion.div` over animating entire tables
- **Do not** add motion to every public/auth page unless explicitly redesigning that page

### New dashboard page checklist

1. Wrap content in `motion.div` with stagger or section delays (match `dashboard/page.tsx`)
2. Use `glass-panel` for main sections
3. Lucide icons (not emoji) for actions and nav
4. Currency: `₹` + `.toLocaleString('en-IN')`
5. Links/actions: teal hover (`text-teal-400 hover:text-teal-300`)
6. Empty states: centered `text-sm text-slate-500` inside glass panel

