## Cursor (mouse) rules

Defaults in `src/app/globals.css`. Use Tailwind only when overriding.

| Element | Cursor |
|---------|--------|
| Button, link, nav, clickable row | `pointer` |
| Checkbox/radio `label` | `pointer` |
| Input, textarea (enabled) | `text` |
| Disabled control | `not-allowed` |
| Loading action | `wait` / `aria-busy="true"` |

`Button` already has `cursor-pointer` and `disabled:cursor-not-allowed`.

---

## API integration

- Add endpoints in `lib/api.ts`; call from pages, not raw `fetch` scattered in components
- Base path: `/api/` (schools) and `/api/payments/` (Razorpay) — see root `README.md`
- Handle errors with toast (`sonner`) or inline messages; 401 → login

## Do not

- Put Django or DB logic in the frontend
- Commit secrets (`.env.local` only)
- Add `cursor-pointer` on disabled or read-only text
- Introduce light-theme dashboard cards (`bg-white`, `border-gray-100`, `text-gray-800`) without explicit product decision
- Duplicate shadcn primitives — extend `components/ui/*` instead
- Add heavy animation libraries beyond Framer Motion already in the project
